                <note rend="inline" type="source">833.5151/460: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Uruguay</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reed</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-01-15T10:00:00-03:00">January 15, 1938—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received January 15—9:05 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5. Unless otherwise instructed I shall defer compliance with Department’s
                    telegram No. 3, January 14, 4 p.m., until 19th in hope of action by Minister of
                    Finance.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reed</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
